Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:03:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Scriptorum and Scrying Chambers doctrines; stage 4 reachable

- Scriptorum T3: Refinement (once per timeline, one card is perfected: a
  seventh upgrade point so both halves reach Stage 4); Dissemination blocked
- Stage 4 was unreachable: Scriptorum T3 now grants Stages 3 and 4 as its
  text says (upgrade screen and minting)
- Scrying T3: Third Eye (the ambush portent, now once per sortie for real,
  and every enemy intent revealed in expedition fights); The Hand blocked
- A staggered enemy's replanned intent honours permanent reveals
- Upgrade badges: 6 and 7 points read Transcendent
- Save asserts for Refined and RefinementsUsed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
